ven when they are outside the immediate expected\nresult.\n\nPreserve meaningful failed approaches and negative results when they may\nconstrain later work.\n\nAvoid flooding durable state with meaningless transient noise.\n\n## Handoff\n\nBefore the invocation ends:\n\n- preserve coherent work\n- run relevant checks\n- inspect Git state\n- write the exact-file pseudocommit manifest requested by the work order\n- write the requested structured handoff result (never update Beads)\n- identify artifacts/evidence\n- identify unresolved failures or ambiguity\n- recommend the next state\n\nAssume the next worker session remembers nothing.\n\n## Prohibitions\n\nThe worker must not:\n\n- canonicalize its own work\n- publish externally\n- merge itself into canonical `main` without authorization\n- bypass manager/human acceptance gates\n- seek unrelated credentials\n- inspect unrelated bulk data\n- silently change global formulas, schemas, or standards to make a local test pass\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
